1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
One checkpoint controls standing and low-speed walking.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,000
At the same target speed, a scalar gait command selects the gait.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:16,500
The same actor accelerates into periodic running and decelerates again.

4
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:21,000
No expert routing. No checkpoint switching. No action blending.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,000
The policy returns to walking and reaches a practical stop.

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Remaining limitation: the strict static-contact standing gate.
